firewall-may-affect-remote = Remote access, such as SSH, stops working if it is not allowed.
firewall-may-affect-sharing = Services other computers use on this one, such as file sharing, stop working.
firewall-may-affect-containers = Container and virtual machine networking may break on some setups.
detect-firewall-title = The firewall on this computer
detect-firewall-active = { $manager } is running and filtering. IbexWall works through it and leaves its rules as they are.
detect-firewall-inactive = { $manager } is installed but not running, so nothing is being filtered. To start it, run: { $start }
detect-firewall-none = No firewall manager was found. IbexWall can still keep its own rules, but a manager is the usual way. To install { $package }, run: { $install }
